 "strategy": "Get Rendili with Mob. Points and deploy first turn.  2 icons for you, one for them, and they only force drain for 1.  Use ROps to deploy sites first, then non-unique imperials(biker scouts).  Use bikers to get speeder bikes from reserve deck.  Get Palpy and Overseeing It Personally out ASAP for better force drains.  Control both Rendili and Ralltiir, Rendili for a battleground syatem to get around Battle Plan and Raltiir to use Fighter Cover.  React around with bikes as needed.  Protect Ralltiir and dont let ITHOTE get flipped back to ROps.",
